The staff's own light, which is the Gorgon's because the Gorgon holds it. RenderCharacter's linked-weapon switch, for anyone holding one (`c->PK < PVP_MURDERER2 && c->Level != 4`):

    case MODEL_GORGON_STAFF:
        Vector(0.f, -90.f, 0.f, Position);
        Vector(Luminosity * 0.4f, Luminosity * 0.8f, Luminosity * 0.6f, Light);
